The existing MIT LICENSE remains applicable to the original MIT codebase.
Selected additions from upstream 2.x are licensed under Apache-2.0; its text
is supplied in LICENSE-APACHE-2.0. This is not a wholesale relicensing or
replacement of the local project.

src/hooks/useOverlayClose.ts and its test are adapted from 0fdae03
(MiaAI Lab, dialog text-selection fix).
The probe recovery and per-slot delta changes follow 8d498be and ffe7964
(Scott Jordan), and the listen-failure / idle serialization safeguards follow
54c5f2e and 37d24c8 (Scott Jordan).
The secrets persistence validation is a local implementation of the data-loss
protection described in upstream 2.70.0. No alert-channel or SMTP feature is added.

server/collectors/roce.js and its test/fixtures are taken from upstream f8b1a48
(Mia's AI Lab, Apache-2.0), based on the RoCE/RDMA collector introduced in
fdd023f and subsequent resilience fixes. The local read-only route and UI
sample only while explicitly expanded; no upstream health thresholds,
network writes, sudo clock operations or background service are activated.

Local modifications retain existing async locks, Chinese copy, themes,
foldable layouts and production collection intervals. New tests use fixtures.
